  × This argument of PlatformColor() is not a literal value.
  
    5 │ const labelColor = 'labelColor';
  > 6 │ const destructured = PlatformColor(labelColor);
      │                                    ^^^^^^^^^^
    7 │ const destructuredDynamic = DynamicColorIOS(colors);
    8 │ const member = ReactNative.PlatformColor(labelColor);
  
  i React Native can only optimize platform colors whose values are written directly in the call.
  
  i Write the color name as a string. The last argument can also be an object like { fallback: "red" }, with a literal value.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

